pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  - elementId: h1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 840, 50]
    content:
      style: "$h1"
      text: 数据与特征工程
  - elementId: tbl
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 110, 520, 160]
    columnWidths: [0.24, 0.26, 0.5]
    rowHeights: [0.17, 0.166, 0.166, 0.166, 0.166, 0.166]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - text: 特征
        - text: 类型
        - text: 地质含义
      - - text: GR
        - text: 自然伽马
        - text: 泥质含量
      - - text: ILD_log10
        - text: 电阻率
        - text: 孔隙流体/渗透性
      - - text: DeltaPHI
        - text: 密度-中子差
        - text: 天然气指示
      - - text: PHIND
        - text: 中子孔隙度
        - text: 孔隙度
      - - text: PE / RELPOS
        - text: 光电 / 相对位置
        - text: 岩性矿物 / 层内位置
  - elementId: tbl-foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 335, 520, 24]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 11
      text: |
        <p><sup>a</sup> 6 维输入特征,StandardScaler 标准化(均值 0, 方差 1)</p>
  - elementId: h2-flow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [620, 110, 280, 36]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      text: 数据流程
  - elementId: f1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [620, 160, 10, 10]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#2E8B7E"}
  - elementId: f1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 148, 260, 40]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: PE 列 22% 缺失 → dropna 删除 917 条
  - elementId: f2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [620, 206, 10, 10]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#2E8B7E"}
  - elementId: f2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 194, 260, 40]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: StandardScaler 标准化(均值 0, 方差 1)
  - elementId: f3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [620, 252, 10, 10]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#2E8B7E"}
  - elementId: f3-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 240, 260, 40]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: 随机打乱 (seed=42) → 前 640 条验证
  - elementId: warn
    elementType: text
    bounds: [620, 300, 280, 70]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:#C0504D;font-weight:bold;">⚠ 数据泄漏</span>:同井相邻样本(岩性几乎相同)被拆进训练/验证,分数虚高。</p>
        <p>改进:按井划分,留出整口 Recruit F9。</p>
  - elementId: chart-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 265, 400, 24]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      fontSize: 14
      text: 训练集类分布(类不平衡)
  - elementId: chart-dist
    elementType: image
    bounds: [60, 292, 315, 180]
    src: "media/chart_dist.png"
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: footer-nav
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 480, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      text: |
        <p>背景  <strong>数据</strong>  模型  训练  结果</p>
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 480, 40, 30]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 03
  - elementId: footer-byline
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 505, 600, 24]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      text: 2026-08 · 测井岩性相分类实验
